          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+(x-1)^2+(x-2)^2+(x-3)^2&=x^2+(x^2-2x+1)+(x^2-4x+4)+(x^2-6x+9)\\\\x^2+(x-1)^2+(x-2)^2+(x-3)^2&=4x^2-(2+4+6)x+(1+4+9)\\\\x^2+(x-1)^2+(x-2)^2+(x-3)^2&=4x^2-12x+14\\end{align*}$$",
